@page
@model Praja.Web.Pages.TransparencyModel
@{ViewData["Title"]="Public progress";}
<div class="main-content"><span class="eyebrow">PUBLIC TRANSPARENCY</span><h1>How complaints are progressing.</h1><p>Local prototype totals by service. Drafts and fictional samples are excluded. No names, complaint text, photos or precise locations are published.</p><p><a href="/PublicMap">Explore nearby complaints</a> · <a href="/Submit">Submit a complaint</a> · <a href="/Track">Track my private case</a></p><section class="panel form-panel"><h2>@Model.Rows.Sum(r=>r.Received) received · @Model.Rows.Sum(r=>r.Closed) closed</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Received</th><th>Open</th><th>Awaiting citizen</th><th>Overdue</th><th>Closed</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach(var row in Model.Rows){<tr><td>@CaseRules.Departments.GetValueOrDefault(row.Department,"Routing review")</td><td>@row.Received</td><td>@row.Open</td><td>@row.AwaitingCitizen</td><td>@row.Overdue</td><td>@row.Closed</td></tr>}</tbody></table></div>@if(Model.Rows.Count==0){<p>No non-sample registered complaints yet.</p>}<p>Overdue means a recorded target date has passed. Historical cases may use the earlier officer closure process. These are workspace totals, not government performance figures.</p></section></div>
